"node_name": &"_GraphNode_29543",
"position": [9240.0, -60.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "",
"text": "The principal gestures to you to come forward.",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_29586": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_29928",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_29586",
"position": [9620.0, -60.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "Principal",
"text": "{Happy}
\"Why don’t you introduce yourself to your new classmates?”",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_29928": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_29962",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_29928",
"position": [10060.0, 80.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "{player}",
"text": "“... Hi my name is {player}. I recently transferred here from SMK Udang Batu. Errr.... Tu jelah I think.”",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_29962": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_30013",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_29962",
"position": [10400.0, 120.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "",
"text": "None of the students paid attention...",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_30013": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_30220",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_30013",
"position": [10740.0, 100.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "Principal",
"text": "“Okaay! Thank you, thank you {player}. Choose your seat.”",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_30220": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_30264",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_30220",
"position": [11140.0, 120.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "",
"text": "The principal leans towards you and quietly talks to you.",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_30264": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_31219",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_30264",
"position": [11560.0, 100.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "Principal",
"text": "{Happy}
“Pick your friends wisely, mana tahu boleh jadi kawan rapat? Haaaa!”",
"type": "dialogue"
},
&"_GraphNode_30786": {
"next_node": "_GraphNode_22360",
"node_name": &"_GraphNode_30786",
"position": [560.0, 0.0],
"set_flags": "",
"speaker": "",
"text": "You're making your way down the hallway, Your heart is shaking as this is your first day in SMK Puncak Tikus Besi. What adventures awaits you I wonder...",
"type": "dialogue"
},
